Package: FunSurv
Title: Joint analysis of recurrent event and longitudinal data using a functional regression approach
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Zifang", "Kong", , "zkong@smu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Sy Han (Steven)", "Chiou", role = "aut"),
      person("Yu-Lun", "Liu", role = c("aut")))
Description: Functions to jointly analyze longitudinal measurements and recurrent events by accommodating both scalar and functional predictors while accounting for time-dependent correlations among events.
